1. In order to ensure the effectiveness of the implementation of KLA development policies in the Region, a KLA Task Force shall be established.
(2) The KLA Task Force as referred to in paragraph (1) shall have the main tasks, namely:
a. coordinating the implementation of KLA policies and development;
b. determining the tasks of KLA Task Force members;
c. conducting socialization, advocacy, and communication of information and education on KLA policies;
d. collecting baseline data;
